# label: alg:ch73-retire
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch73.tex:122
# caption: Retire a registration through a stable serialized admission gate.

REQUIRE stable gate shared by every admission; caller is not its own active callback
ENSURE no callback can use the reclaimed context
under gate mutex: mark registration as not accepting
remove it from future library dispatch under the library's unregister contract
wait for active count to become zero, releasing the mutex while waiting
detach context and trampoline from the registry
release runtime root and executable closure storage through their owners

